#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`walkinglabs/awesome-harness-engineering` — the canonical ongoing curated "
"list {cite}`walkinglabs2026awesome`. **Scope difference from this book.** "
"This book is a long-form methodology with strong opinions, dual-track "
"research-plus-practice, and an enforceable dual-track lint rule; the "
"*awesome* list is an ongoing unopinionated curation of papers, posts, and "
"projects. The two are complements, not substitutes."
msgstr ""
"`walkinglabs/awesome-harness-engineering` —— 权威的、持续更新的精选列表 "
"{cite}`walkinglabs2026awesome`。**与本书的范围差别**：本书是一份长篇方法论，带强立场、\"研究 ＋ "
"实践\"双轨、以及一条可强制执行的双轨 lint 规则；而 *awesome* "
"列表则是一份不持立场、持续更新的论文、博文与项目精选。二者是互补关系，不是替代关系。"

